{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>【Now新聞台】行政長官李家超今日出席APEC工商領導人峰會開幕式及專題研討。另外，尖東聖誕燈飾亮燈，民政及青年事務局局長麥美娟、文化體育及旅遊局局長羅淑佩等擔任主禮嘉賓。</p><p>採訪日誌｜李家超出席APEC工商領導人峰會／尖東聖誕燈飾亮燈</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T23:45:14.082083+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T23:32:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T23:38:36.472499+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T23:38:36.472499+00:00","content_hash":"44b3eff2885aa61338d6d424bfa392e3e9b726b4ceff37affeda002f1f1c2355","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}